# Class: <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00000118> (Strukturiertheit)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/hob/HDO_00000118> "A quality which inheres in a bearer by virtue of that bearer's parts being intentionally held in relation to one another by some means."@en)
